      "text": "[7:37AM] \n#Ojo\n#IyanaIba\n#TrafficUpdate\nWe are having a good movement from Agbara Customs Checkpoint to Iyana Era. \nThe stretch of Iyana Era to Afromedia is good. \nSmooth ride from Afromedia to Iyana Iba en route Volks. \nAscending Iyana Iba flyover towards Volks is good, likewise  underneath the flyover inward Igando is equally good to go. \nVolks connecting Barracks en route Abule Ado is a seamless movement. \nNote:\n The picture above is Alaba Rago axis inward Iyana Iba.\n\n#FollowLASTMA\n@trafficpalava \n@lagostraffic961 \n@TrafficChiefNG",
